        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: G. D. Spradlin, Marlon Brando, Al Pacino, Charlton Heston, George C. Scott, Johnny Depp\n- Films and TV: On the Waterfront, The Godfather, A Streetcar Named Desire, Viva Zapata!\n- Topics: acting credits, co-stars, Academy Award-winning performances\n\nFacts:\n- Marlon Brando is widely known for his Academy Award-winning performances as Terry Malloy in On the Waterfront (1954) and Vito Corleone in The Godfather (1972).\n- Marlon Brando is also known for his performances in A Streetcar Named Desire (1951) and Viva Zapata!.\n- G. D. Spradlin is credited in over 70 television and film productions.\n- G. D. Spradlin performed alongside actors including Marlon Brando, Al Pacino, Charlton Heston, George C. Scott, and Johnny Depp.",
